<p>Sing a song of violence and victory (mostly violence) and sustain yourself through cruelty.</p><p>Each time you deal a critical strike you gain 10% of a turn (only once per turn).</p><p>Each time you kill a creature you gain <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">28%, 41%, 50%, 56%, 61%</acronym> of a turn (only once per turn).</p><p></p>